{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014pFhPpjjqRtUE73e4hNLZs","type":"tool_result","content":"build invocation 01 for item 264: the Plan store and attavo plan\n\nAdds attavo/store.py (versioned documents under the git common dir,\noutside git, with hard-link-race refusal) and attavo/plan.py (the\nPlan's order as one document: epics and issues in rank order, depends\nand ruled edges, policy), wires `attavo plan get|put|log|rank|move`\ninto the CLI, and adds schema/plan.schema.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---\nattavo: build invocation 01 for item 281 (attavo frontier: the waves)\n\nAdds `attavo frontier [--json]`, computing the waves from the plan's\nlatest version in the store, the tenant's issues, and work in flight\nfrom git, per the stub on 7a5cbfb.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f72eeed-ce9e-4916-937c-8eb7f16a3662","uuid":"022095ec-6a84-4b0b-8b97-147bd0c6929a","timestamp":"2026-10-07T21:30:30.326Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"build invocation 01 for item 264: the Plan store and attavo plan\n\nAdds attavo/store.py (versioned documents under the git common dir,\noutside git, with hard-link-race refusal) and attavo/plan.py (the\nPlan's order as one document: epics and issues in rank order, depends\nand ruled edges, policy), wires `attavo plan get|put|log|rank|move`\ninto the CLI, and adds schema/plan.schema.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---\nattavo: build invocation 01 for item 281 (attavo frontier: the waves)\n\nAdds `attavo frontier [--json]`, computing the waves from the plan's\nlatest version in the store, the tenant's issues, and work in flight\nfrom git, per the stub on 7a5cbfb.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014pFhPpjjqRtUE73e4hNLZs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
